        <mxCell id="cell_18" value="REAL-TIME SECURITY ANALYSIS &amp;amp; TELEMETRY
• Sender Domain Mismatch: Suspicious (.net vs .edu.ph)
• Urgency Manipulation: Threatening deadline
• Malicious Anchor Tag: Masked fake domain
• Header DKIM/SPF: FAILED / SPOOFED

Score: 100/100 | Threat Level: CRITICAL (98%)
Educational Takeaway: Never enter institutional credentials on unverified third-party domains." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#151926;strokeColor=#F59E0B;fontColor=#F8FAFC;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
